      "filename": "A work crew viewing the high water levels on the Feather River in California.jpg",
      "title": "File:A work crew viewing the high water levels on the Feather River in California.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/A_work_crew_viewing_the_high_water_levels_on_the_Feather_River_in_California.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
